      ],
      "text": "DEV:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        208.2346954345703,
        439.5812683105469,
        227.03359985351562
      ],
      "text": "What did you think about the evolutionary theory of loneliness?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        239.97206115722656,
        128.42164611816406,
        259.47344970703125
      ],
      "text": "TAMARA:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        260.0746765136719,
        520.2840576171875,
        318.5926208496094
      ],
      "text": "Well I thought the idea that loneliness evolved because it motivated people to\nbe with other people is quite convincing. Survival often depended on group\ncooperation.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        331.4110412597656,
        99.86299896240234,
        350.9124450683594
      ],
      "text": "DEV:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        351.5146789550781,
        518.2141723632812,
        410.0335998535156
      ],
      "text": "But I don't think there is enough evidence to claim that there must be a group\nof neurons in our brains which influence social behaviour by making us feel\nbad when we're alone.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        422.85205078125,
        128.42164611816406,
        442.35345458984375
      ],
      "text": "TAMARA:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        442.9546813964844,
        526.7388305664062,
        481.6736145019531
      ],
      "text": "There are a few studies which support the theory, but not conclusively enough.\nMore evidence is needed.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        494.4920349121094,
        99.86299896240234,
        513.9934692382812
      ],
      "text": "DEV:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        514.5936889648438,
        482.30108642578125,
        553.192626953125
      ],
      "text": "And anyway, this theory's not really useful when it comes to solving the\nproblem of loneliness today.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        566.1320190429688,
        128.42164611816406,
        585.6334228515625
      ],
